especially who led the
development of Humming

1396
01:33:30,260 --> 01:33:32,620
alongside myself and the BLM community

1397
01:33:32,620 --> 01:33:36,080
for continuously trying
to push the standards

1398
01:33:36,080 --> 01:33:38,960
of quantization and
distribute it to the AI

1399
